                            <details id="portals-company" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am a</span> Company officeholder</summary>
                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content" >
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-co" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-co" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-co-register" selected="" value="co-register">Register a new company</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-update" value="co-update">Manage my company details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-close" value="co-close">Download my annual review statement</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-lodge" value="co-lodge">Lodge regulatory documents</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-co-learn" value="co-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-register">
                                        <p>Information and steps on how to register a new business</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-business-and-companies/companies/register-a-company/">Register a company</a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-update" hidden="">
                                        <p>Manage your company details via the company officeholder portal: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>Update your company details</li>
                                            <li>Voluntarily deregister your company in the Company officeholder portal.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/004/compportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-close" hidden="">
                                        <p>Download your company annual review statement from ASIC, which includes your annual invoice and payment details.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/004/compportal/get/ServicesLogin"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://www.edge.asic.gov.au/cgi-bin/Lodgement/RC99V004/start/ApplicationLogin">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-lodge" hidden="">
                                        <p>Lodge regulatory statements, documents and transactions in the Regulatory portal.</p>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/Account/SignIn"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/registration/">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-co" id="content-co-learn" hidden="">
                                        <p>Within online services for company officeholders, you can: </p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>log in or sign up to ASIC's portals</li>
                                            <li>learn about ASIC's online services and processes</li>
                                            <li>access user guides.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/company-officeholders/">Company officeholders</a>
