                            <details id="portals-afs" class="asic-accordion__item" name="accordion-portal-group">
                                <summary class="asic-accordion__title asic-portal-accordian-banner"><span class="asic-portal-hidden">I am an</span> AFS Licensee and AFS representative</summary>
                                <div class="asic-tabs__panel asic-content">
                                    <div class="asic-field">
                                        <label for="select-my-task-afs" class="asic-field__label">I want to</label>
                                        <select id="select-my-task-afs" class="asic-select asic-select--fill select-portal" aria-required="true">
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-apply" selected="" value="afs-apply">Apply for and vary an AFS licence</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-update" value="afs-update">Update licence details and submit documents</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-appoint" value="afs-appoint">Appoint and update representative's details</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-lodge" value="afs-lodge">Lodge regulatory transactions</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-mis" value="afs-mis">Register a managed investment scheme</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-pds" value="afs-pds">Lodge a PDS in-use notice</option>
                                            <option data-open="content-afs-learn" value="afs-learn">Learn about ASIC's online services</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-apply">
                                        <p>Information and steps on how to apply for an Australian financial services (AFS) licence.</p>
                                        <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary asic-button--allow-wrap asic-button--small" href="/for-finance-professionals/afs-licensees/applying-for-and-managing-an-afs-licence/">Applying for and managing an AFS licence</a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-update" hidden="">
                                        <p>Update your AFS licence details and lodge financial document via the Regulatory portal.</p><a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/for-finance-professionals/afs-licensees/changing-details-and-lodging-afs-forms/afs-licensees-changing-your-licence-details-through-the-regulatory-portal/">Changing your licence details through the Regulatory Portal</a>
                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/Account/SignIn"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://regulatoryportal.asic.gov.au/registration/">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-afs" id="content-afs-appoint" hidden="">
                                        <p>Log in to ASIC Connect to appoint and update AFS representative's details.</p>
                                        <div>
                                            <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="/online-services/asic-portals/financial-advisers-and-authorised-representatives/">Financial advisers and authorised representatives</a>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="portal-button-collection">
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Already have an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--primary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/landingPage.jsp"><span class="asic-icon" data-symbol="account_circle"></span>Log in</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <span class="asic-text-body-xsmall">Need to create an account?</span>
                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/GetStarted">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
